{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_240_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_240","textTraditional":"一、十有三年。春，鄭軒達帥師取宋于嵒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_240_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_240","textTraditional":"其言取之何？易也。其易奈何？詐反也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_240_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_240","textTraditional":"二、夏，許男戌卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_240_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_240","textTraditional":"三、公會晉侯及吳子于黃池。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_240_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_240","textTraditional":"吳何以稱子？吳主會也。吳主會則曷為先言晉侯？不與夷狄之主中國也。其言及吳子何？會兩伯之辭也。不與夷狄之主中國，則曷為以會兩伯之辭言之？重吳也。曷為重吳？吳在是則天下諸侯莫敢不至也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_240_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_240","textTraditional":"四、楚公子申帥師伐陳。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_240_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_240","textTraditional":"五、於越入吳。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_240_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_240","textTraditional":"六、秋，公至自會。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_240_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_240","textTraditional":"七、晉魏多帥師侵衞。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_240_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_240","textTraditional":"此晉魏曼多也，曷為謂之晉魏多？譏二名，二名非禮也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_240_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_240","textTraditional":"八、葬許元公。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_240_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_240","textTraditional":"九、九月，〈虫衆〉。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_240_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_240","textTraditional":"十、冬十有一月，有星孛于東方。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_240_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_240","textTraditional":"孛者何？彗星也。其言于東方何？見于旦也。何以書？記異也。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_cdt_240_15","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_240","textTraditional":"十一、盜殺陳夏彄夫。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_cdt_240_16","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_240","textTraditional":"十二、十有二月，〈虫衆〉。","sentenceOrder":16}],"overrides":{}}